1
00:00:00,903 --> 00:00:02,133
- Hello?
- Hey.

2
00:00:02,338 --> 00:00:05,468
(Howard:)- How'd it go last night with my mom?
- Okay, I guess.

3
00:00:05,674 --> 00:00:06,834
(Howard:)What time did you leave?

4
00:00:09,478 --> 00:00:11,968
(Raj:)Actually, I'm still here.

5
00:00:12,948 --> 00:00:16,648
- What? You spent the night?
- Yeah.

6
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:20,779
(Raj:)After dinner,
we watched a rerun of Rockford Files...

7
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,460
(Raj:)...and then she opened
a bottle of cream sherry...

8
00:00:23,659 --> 00:00:27,559
(Raj:)...and the next thing I know
she was tucking me into your bed.

9
00:00:29,799 --> 00:00:31,169
You wore my pajamas?

10
00:00:31,333 --> 00:00:32,563
(Raj:)Mm-hm.

11
00:00:32,868 --> 00:00:36,138
(Raj:)How do you sleep in these things?
Silk pajamas on satin sheets?

12
00:00:36,338 --> 00:00:39,098
(Raj:)I slid out of the bed like three times.

13
00:00:40,476 --> 00:00:42,346
Rajesh? You up?

14
00:00:42,578 --> 00:00:43,838
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)You ready for breakfast?

15
00:00:44,079 --> 00:00:45,669
(Raj:)Oh, boy, breakfast.

16
00:00:47,116 --> 00:00:49,376
(Howard:)Okay, Raj, listen.
You need to get out of there.

17
00:00:49,618 --> 00:00:53,718
(Raj:)But I have a cream sherry hangover
and I smell blintzes.

18
00:00:55,224 --> 00:00:59,384
(Howard:)If you don't leave now, she'll use food and
guilt to keep you there the rest of your life.

